  "decisions": [
    "kt00009 POST /api/dostk/acnt exposes cntr_no 7-digit native execution identity plus cntr_qty/cntr_uv in execution row. Unlike ka10076, it supports native ID dedup.",
    "Request ord_dt explicitday, stk_bond_tp=1,mrkt_tp=0,sell_tp=0,qry_tp=1,dmst_stex_tp=KRX,optionalstk_cd. No reverse targetord_no cursor misuse.",
    "Response acnt_ord_cntr_prst_array. Filter exact native ord_no+symbol; credit/cancel/modify/nonexecution rows must not become fill. Source exec ID namespaced day/order/cntr_no; NEVER invented timestamp fill ID.",
    "No per-execution fee is declared. Missing fee remains unknown; do not convert vendor day aggregate ka10076 into perfill fee or infer notional from latest price. Unknown fee keeps economic readiness blocked for CAP03.",
    "Kiwoom polling uses bounded complete day/history pages. Missing/invalid cont-yn,missing orcyclic nextkey/foreignsymbol/nativeID/nonfiniteqty/price/unknownhistory never permit baseline ready.",
    "kt00007 mdfy_cncl=취소확인, ori_ord, cnfm_qty, ord_remnq are explicit native cancellation facts; match exact original order and complete kt00009 native execution sums before terminal cancellation. Cancel ACK alone remains pending."
  ],
